classDiagram
    class Runner {
        +validate_input()
        +execute_logic()
        +format_output()
    }
    class Objective {
        +suggest_params()
        +objective()
    }
    class ResultsDB {
        +save_trial()
        +best_trial()
    }
    class Visualizer {
        +main()
    }
    class DataLoader {
        +load_mnist_numpy()
    }
    Runner ..> Objective : 最適化依頼
    Objective ..> ResultsDB : 記録・取得
    Runner ..> Visualizer : 描画依頼
    Objective ..> DataLoader : データ取得
